# Travel Assistant Chatbot

## Overview
This project is a Python chatbot designed to help users plan trips by offering travel tips, packing suggestions, and destination ideas.

## Problem
Travel planning can be overwhelming for people who are unsure where to go or what to pack.

## My Approach
I built a chatbot that interacts with the user through the terminal. The chatbot asks questions about travel preferences and then provides helpful suggestions.

